# 统一行尾：文本文件一律入库为 LF，检出按平台处理，避免跨平台噪音 diff
* text=auto

*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.txt text eol=lf

*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pyc binary
